# Scanner artifacts: point-in-time discovery output, regenerated by `brain scan`.
.scan/

# NOTE: graph.html is deliberately NOT ignored here.
# Agent-Brain's default template ignores it as a derived artifact. We commit it
# instead so the knowledge graph is openable from a fresh clone (and on GitHub)
# without anyone needing to know the CLI exists. Regenerate after changing
# .brain/ with:  node vendor/agent-brain/bin/brain graph .
